!!import:"https://tson.io/2026/39/m/core.tn"
!!import:"https://tson.io/test-suite/schemas/fixtures/validate-kind-stock.tn"
@doc:"""
  A kind-typed field: `ledger.named` is `kind<uuid_type>`, whose values are the names of the types in this
  schema's closure built with `uuid_type` -- `customer_id` declared here, `stock_id` from the import, and core's
  `uuid`. A value there is one of those names, never a uuid. `sku` is text, built with `text_type`, and no member.
  """
{
  customer_id => !uuid_type {}
  sku         => text
  ledger      => { named: kind<uuid_type> }
}
